{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46912","headline":"和翁员外题马太傅宅贾相公井 · 齐己","name":"和翁员外题马太傅宅贾相公井","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"飞尘不敢下相干，闇脉傍应润牡丹。\n心任短长投玉绠，底须三五映金盘。\n神工旧制泓澄在，天泽时加潋灧寒。\n太傅欲旌前古事，星郎属思久凭栏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46912.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46912","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}